Small historical note:  in pre-3.0 NetHack, leprechauns were L, leocrottas were
l, and liches did not exist.  These NetHacks didn't have color, but if they did,
they might have had green L.

Furthermore, color first appeared in 3.0.4 (29 Sep 1989), and leprechauns
changed places with liches in 3.0.6 (22 Nov 1989).  So mainline NetHack did
indeed have green L -- for all of 54 days in 1989.

